03:09.000 --> 03:13.320
So I mean, I have no, I have nothing really to say other than just, I don't know how

03:13.320 --> 03:14.320
he got there.

03:14.320 --> 03:18.800
It's probably, I'm trying to remember, someone got penalties, right, in the sprint race?

03:18.800 --> 03:19.800
Other than just like-

03:19.800 --> 03:25.720
I think there were quite a few penalties, I don't actually remember.

03:25.720 --> 03:30.440
