03:51.000 --> 03:56.600
on the track, he just continued to slide out of the pits and hit the wall.

03:56.600 --> 04:00.080
Watching that replay actually made me laugh, I actually could not-, I was like-

04:00.080 --> 04:04.520
It was the most anti-climactic crash I've ever seen.

04:04.520 --> 04:05.520
Literally.

04:05.520 --> 04:09.320
