04:13.400 --> 04:18.160
To be fair, this happened when this was like, everyone, when the safety car came out for

04:18.160 --> 04:23.360
Van Hoepen and everyone pitted for slicks, and he stayed out of the alternative strategy.

04:23.360 --> 04:29.200
