04:46.520 --> 04:48.840
Uh, yeah, I think so.

04:48.840 --> 04:51.120
Probably would have been on the podium.

04:51.120 --> 04:52.640
Why is Maini still here?

04:52.640 --> 04:53.640
Yeah.

04:53.640 --> 04:57.920
I don't understand how he's here, or how Alpine justifies to keep him in the academy,

04:57.920 --> 04:59.800
