05:03.000 --> 05:04.840
I love motorsports, guys.

05:04.840 --> 05:05.840
I love motorsports.

05:05.840 --> 05:06.840
I love motorsports.

05:06.840 --> 05:07.840
I love everything about it.

05:07.840 --> 05:10.040
